node_modules/
.aider*

# OS noise — never functional, and `git add -A` in the code-agent commit path
# will otherwise sweep it into the repo (that is how .DS_Store, aider-output.md
# and two files named from LLM prose reached main).
.DS_Store

# NOTE: .gestalt/ is deliberately NOT ignored. On a FEATURE branch it is
# functional — `.gestalt/architecture/*.json` is what a consulted architect reads
# (ROLE_ARTIFACTS), and `.gestalt/<correlation-id>/` holds the design artifacts a
# self-heal retry ADOPTS instead of regenerating. Ignoring it would silently break
# both. What was removed from `main` was 52 dead correlation directories from
# finished runs, which are scratch only once their run has ended.
